Das ist genau das Richtige, um bei langen Familienessen nicht einzuschlafen.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13796,'en','This Trophy oozes a slippery liquid that gives you the upper hand when escaping from Lock-happy opponents.
Just don''t be surprised when you don''t get any free hugs on Ballotwine''s Day.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13796,'fr','De ce Trophée suinte un liquide visqueux vous permettant d''esquiver les tentatives d''entrave de vos adversaires.
Vos câlins seront également beaucoup moins rugueux.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13796,'es','Con este trofeo rezuma un líquido viscoso gracias al cual podrás esquivar las tentativas de bloqueo de tus adversarios.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13796,'pt','Desse troféu escorre um líquido viscoso muito útil na hora de se esquivar de um obstáculo imposto por um adversário. E seus carinhos serão muito menos ásperos agora.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13796,'de','Mit dieser Trophäe in eurem Besitz müsst ihr euch nicht mehr vor euren Gegnern fürchten... Entschwindet ganz einfach klammheimlich, still und leise...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13797,'en','This Trophy oozes a slippery liquid that gives you the upper hand when escaping from Lock-happy opponents.
Just don''t be surprised when you don''t get any free hugs on Ballotwine''s Day.');
